FIDONET nodes around the country.  I keep copies of the executable and
documentation in ARC5.LBR on both FIDONET nodes that I operate.  If there is
enough interest in posting a uuencoded copy of the library, I will get in
touch with the authors and if they are amenable, I will post it.

